'''Hologram '''is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]] by purchasing the [[2025 Halloween Box]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife has glowing accents, creating a bright display. The handle of this knife is made of a dark shade, contrasting the bright, colorful blade.
== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Hologram (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
